Attributions
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The model and training/inference scaffolding are derived from Andrej Karpathy's
nanoGPT / minGPT line of teaching GPTs
(https://github.com/karpathy/nanoGPT, MIT License), reworked here with a PyTorch
training loop, byte-level BPE tokenization, a TinyStories data pipeline, and a
gradient-free (simulated-annealing) training variant, so the model can be
trained from scratch to study quality at minimal parameter counts.

The TinyStories corpus used for training and evaluation is from:

  Eldan, R. and Li, Y. "TinyStories: How Small Can Language Models Be and Still
  Speak Coherent English?" arXiv:2305.07759 (2023).
  Dataset: roneneldan/TinyStories on Hugging Face.
